开头 点题:Knowing how to treat a burn can make a big difference.
第一步 First, place the burn under cool running water… because…
中间 Next, dry the area… Then cover it loosely…
禁忌 Never put oil on a burn, as it keeps the heat in.
收尾 Finally, if the burn is serious, take the victim to hospital at once.', 2, 'elective2', 'U5');

